## CaptureEvidence

One press. Five shots. Tamper-proof evidence.

CaptureEvidence is a single-button field tool for people facing property damage, leaks, delivery disputes, or on-site incidents. It turns chaotic panic-photography into an ordered, hash-verified, read-only evidence package.

GUIDED FORENSIC CAPTURE

• Long-press to start a new evidence event
• Safety and legality confirmation before any camera access
• Fixed five-step sequence: scene-wide, damage subject, detail, scale reference, meter/label
• Add a factual note (not a fault judgment) after completing all five shots

TAMPER-PROOF INTEGRITY

• SHA-256 hash computed for every original photo immediately after capture
• Read-only manifest with per-file hashes and a package fingerprint
• Originals are never modified or edited
• Event timeline shows all captures in step order with timestamps

PRIVATE AND SHAREABLE

• Redacted share copies with draggable blur masking for faces, plates, and addresses
• ZIP export with originals, redacted copies, manifest.json, and note.txt
• Share via system share sheet (Files, AirDrop, Mail)
• All data stays on-device with no server, no cloud, no analytics

CaptureEvidence is available in English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, and Spanish.

One press. Five shots. Tamper-proof evidence.
